# Agent Definitions Table

The `agent_definitions` table stores agent definition archives (Docker build contexts).

{{ describe_relation("agent_definitions") }}

## CLI Commands

Use the CLI to fetch and create definitions:

```bash
# Fetch existing definition to a directory
props agent-definition fetch <definition_id> /workspace/my_def/

# Create new definition from a directory
props agent-definition create /workspace/my_def/
```
